 ```
 
-### A Regra de Ouro
+### The Golden Rule
 
 ```
-E/S (I/O-bound) → async (esperando por algo externo)
-CPU-bound → sync + multiprocessing (computando)
+I/O-bound → async (waiting for external)
+CPU-bound → sync + multiprocessing (computing)
 
